import{_ as e,o,c as n,a2 as i}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 380 | Dou Continent · Anchor-Symbiosis Alternative: Symbiosis Transformation of the Soul-Ring System","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 380 | Dou Continent · Anchor-Symbiosis Alternative: Symbiosis Transformation of the Soul-Ring System","no":380,"module":2,"tags":["Dou Continent","Anchor Symbiosis","Soul Rings","Symbiosis Transformation","Alternative"],"related":["03-Symbiotic Civilization Charter","25-Symbiotic Feedback Loop Mechanism","12-Life-Circulation System Detail"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0380_模块2-斗罗-锚点共生替代方案-魂环体系的共生化改造.md","filePath":"en/0380_模块2-斗罗-锚点共生替代方案-魂环体系的共生化改造.md"}'),s={name:"en/0380_模块2-斗罗-锚点共生替代方案-魂环体系的共生化改造.md"};function a(r,t,l,h,u,c){return o(),n("div",null,[...t[0]||(t[0]=[i('<h1 id="entry-380-dou-continent-·-anchor-symbiosis-alternative-symbiosis-transformation-of-the-soul-ring-system" tabindex="-1">Entry 380 | Dou Continent · Anchor-Symbiosis Alternative: Symbiosis Transformation of the Soul-Ring System <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-380-dou-continent-·-anchor-symbiosis-alternative-symbiosis-transformation-of-the-soul-ring-system" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 380 | Dou Continent · Anchor-Symbiosis Alternative: Symbiosis Transformation of the Soul-Ring System&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Dou Continent System Decomposition (Entry 21 · Alternative) | Benchmark base: Documents 03, 25, 12</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-not-abolish-soul-rings-but-let-them-grow" tabindex="-1">Introduction: Not abolish soul rings, but let them grow <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-not-abolish-soul-rings-but-let-them-grow" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: Not abolish soul rings, but let them grow&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Heng Yuan Zhou does not advocate simply &quot;abolishing soul rings&quot; — that would cut off hundreds of millions of human cultivators&#39; roads. The true symbiotic alternative is to transform the soul-ring system from &quot;seizing-type&quot; to &quot;symbiosis-type&quot;: preserve the function of &quot;soul rings assisting breakthroughs,&quot; change their source from hunting to symbiotic circulation. This entry, taking the law-first axiom as core, gives the symbiosis-transformation plan for the soul-ring system. Protagonist uniqueness dependency: <strong>Dou = high; after transformation = network-style</strong>. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s judging base has been upgraded to the six top-level axioms.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>After symbiosis transformation:</p><ul><li><strong>Other-Origin backflow</strong>: soul beasts&#39; voluntarily offered Origin feeds back via the life-circulation system, no longer killed and done</li><li><strong>Two-way circulation</strong>: human cultivators convert and help soul beasts evolve, in exchange for Origin resonance, forming Myriad-Rank Origin two-way circulation</li><li><strong>Sharp loss drop</strong>: from &quot;kill-and-take&quot; to &quot;resonance,&quot; loss rate plummets</li></ul><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression-blocked-after-transformation" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression (Blocked After Transformation) <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression-blocked-after-transformation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression (Blocked After Transformation)&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Species reconciliation</strong>: soul beasts and humans change from hunting relation to symbiotic relation; ecological disaster lifted</li><li><strong>Circulation self-perpetuation</strong>: the life-circulation system makes Origin endless</li><li><strong>Institutions chartered</strong>: symbiotic relation written into charter, not tied to any strong one&#39;s goodwill</li></ol><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking-after-transformation" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking (After Transformation) <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking-after-transformation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking (After Transformation)&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>From &quot;seize&quot; to &quot;symbiosis&quot;</strong>: Origin needed for breakthrough no longer relies on seizing, but on symbiotic resonance with soul beasts</li><li><strong>The other as partner</strong>: human-form soul beasts and humans collaborate equally; species barriers broken</li><li><strong>Lin-Hao-style demonstration</strong>: breaking through via the symbiotic path proves &quot;rings can be co-built&quot;</li></ul><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative-transformation-contrast" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative (Transformation Contrast) <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative-transformation-contrast" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative (Transformation Contrast)&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Original Hunting Ring</th><th>Symbiosis Transformation</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Kill soul beast for ring</td><td>Resonate and symbiosize with soul beast for ring</td></tr><tr><td>Soul beast = consumable</td><td>Soul beast = symbiotic partner</td></tr><tr><td>One-way consumption</td><td>Myriad-Rank Origin two-way circulation</td></tr><tr><td>Species opposition</td><td>Myriad Ranks republican co-build</td></tr><tr><td>One person&#39;s kindness</td><td>Charter guarantee</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The alternative&#39;s crux: soul rings remain, but change from &quot;loot&quot; to &quot;symbiotic contract.&quot;</p><p>The key of symbiosis transformation is turning soul rings from &quot;loot&quot; to &quot;contract.&quot; Path D · human-engineered Dao-Law soul rings here run parallel with symbiotic resonance: human cultivators and soul beasts mutually help evolution, Origin two-way circulation; Lin-Hao-style strong ones walk precisely this non-killing road. Soul beasts need not human-form themselves to equally evolve within the symbiotic network via the self-generation self-growth law.</p><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Modeling</strong>: replicate the symbiotic resonance mechanism</li><li><strong>Variables</strong>: Group A hunting; Group B symbiosis transformation</li><li><strong>Observation</strong>: human breakthrough rate, soul-beast well-being, Myriad-Rank conflict intensity</li><li><strong>Review</strong>: output &quot;Soul-Ring Symbiosis-Transformation Benefit Assessment&quot;</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Post-transformation self-consistency: high</strong>. The symbiotic mechanism is defined by the life-circulation system, early-late consistent</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk: near zero</strong></li><li><strong>Comparison</strong>: Dou relies on &quot;spirit soul&quot; patches half-changing; the transformation plan does it in one step</li></ul><p>The subtlety of symbiosis transformation is that it preserves the ring&#39;s function, only changing the ring&#39;s source. Human cultivators need not give up soul rings&#39; assistance; soul beasts need not lose their lives for it. From &quot;loot&quot; to &quot;contract,&quot; one character&#39;s difference separates two worlds.</p><p>Symbiosis transformation must also solve the &quot;willingness&quot; problem: why should soul beasts resonate with humans? The answer lies not in moral preaching, but in a win-win structure — human cultivators convert and help them break through; soul beasts share Origin resonance dividends. When cooperation is more worthwhile than confrontation, species reconciliation changes from &quot;wish&quot; to &quot;rational choice.&quot; Lin-Hao-style reconstructors design precisely this win-win structure, rather than unilaterally demanding soul beasts &quot;put down hatred.&quot;</p><p>Symbiosis transformation must also face human cultivators&#39; real path dependence. Accustomed to &quot;hunt ring = level up,&quot; suddenly walking the symbiotic road, they doubt &quot;can this really make one strong?&quot; The answer must come from data and demonstration: the height Lin-Hao-style strong ones reach via the symbiotic path proves this road is not only morally right, but in strength no less than hunting. When doubters see &quot;not killing can also reach the top,&quot; path dependence loosens — the alternative&#39;s promotion relies on strength proof, not moral preaching.</p><p>Supplementary verdict: symbiosis transformation must solve path dependence. Humans accustomed to hunting rings, suddenly walking symbiosis, doubt &quot;can one really get strong?&quot; The answer comes from data and demonstration: Lin-Hao-style strong ones prove not killing can also reach the top. When doubters see strength no less than hunting, path dependence loosens — the alternative&#39;s promotion relies on strength proof, not moral preaching.</p><p>The alternative&#39;s true promotion moment is the day doubters with their own eyes see not killing can also reach the top — strength proof is always more persuasive than moral slogans.</p><p>When doubters see with their own eyes, the Dao is no longer only written on paper.</p><p>When &quot;not killing can also reach the top&quot; changes from slogan to real role models one by one, path dependence naturally disintegrates. The alternative&#39;s greatest persuasion is never how morally correct it is, but that in strength it never concedes defeat.</p><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: loss plummets from kill-and-take to resonance</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: the other changes from consumable to partner</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo at least did not make Myriad Ranks into consumables; after transformation Dou catches up to this bottom line</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: soul beasts formally enter the symbiotic network</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: the symbiosis mechanism can be exported to any plane with companion species</li><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power is inherent in all; the easygoing retain a guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin erases predatory motivation, predatory involution loses meaning from the root</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Soul rings need not be blood; they can be contracts. What Heng Yuan Zhou wants is not to abolish soul rings, but to turn them from &quot;rings stepped on soul beasts&quot; into &quot;rings grown together with soul beasts.&quot;</p><p>In the final analysis, Dou Continent · Anchor-Symbiosis alternative · symbiosis transformation of the soul-ring system described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./377_模块2-斗罗-D路线替代方案-人族人造道则魂环.html">Entry 377 · Path D Alternative</a> · <a href="./385_模块2-斗罗-万族共和方案-打破人族本位与武魂歧视.html">Entry 385 · Myriad-Ranks Republican Plan</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/03-共生文明宪章.html">03-Symbiotic Civilization Charter</a></li></ul>',34)])])}const d=e(s,[["render",a]]);export{g as __pageData,d as default};
